     5783                End.
     5784                 accumulate f-qnty           (TOTAL ) .
     5785                 accumulate f-cost-sum       (TOTAL ) .
     5786                 accumulate f-sale-sum       (TOTAL ) .
     5787                 accumulate f-sale-other     (TOTAL ) .
